===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} A [[combination]] of a [[user]]'s [[identification]] and [[password]] used to enter a [[computer]], [[program]], [[network]], etc.
#: {{ux|en|I've forgotten my '''login''' again.}}
# {{lb|en|computing}} The [[process]] of logging in.
#: {{ux|en|Your '''login''' failed because you weren't connected to the office network.}}

